    {
      "speaker": "Icarus",
      "content": "<div class=\"dnd5e2 chat-card activation-card\">\n    <section class=\"card-header description collapsible\">\n        <header class=\"summary\">\n            <img class=\"gold-icon\" src=\"icons/magic/control/fear-fright-monster-grin-green.webp\" alt=\"Frightful Presence\" />\n            <div class=\"name-stacked border\">\n                <span class=\"title\">Frightful Presence</span>\n                <span class=\"subtitle\">Feature</span>\n            </div>\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-down fa-fw\" inert></i>\n        </header>\n        <section class=\"details collapsible-content card-content\">\n            <div class=\"wrapper\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>Each creature of the dragon's choice that is within 120 feet of the dragon and aware of it must succeed on a DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">18</span> Wisdom saving throw or become <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-plut-hover-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-plut-hover-source=\"PHB\" data-plut-hover-hash=\"frightened_phb\" data-plut-hover-tag=\"condition\" data-plut-hover-hash-pre-encoded=\"true\" data-plut-hover-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" data-plut-rich-link=\"true\" data-plut-rich-link-entity-type=\"Item\" data-plut-rich-link-original-text=\"condition[frightened]\" data-plut-rich-link-tag-tag=\"condition\" data-plut-rich-link-tag-text=\"frightened\"><i class=\"fas fa-solid fa-suitcase\"></i> frightened</a> for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature's saving throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is immune to the dragon's Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours.</p><div class=\"rd__spc-inline-post\"></div></div></div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"card-buttons\">\n        <button type=\"button\" data-dc=\"18\" data-ability=\"wis\" data-action=\"rollSave\" data-visibility=\"all\">\n            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-heart\" inert></i> <span>\n          <span class=\"visible-dc\">DC 18 Wisdom Saving Throw</span>\n          <span class=\"hidden-dc\">Wisdom Saving Throw</span>\n        </span>\n        </button>\n    </div>\n\n\n    <ul class=\"card-footer pills unlist\">\n        <li class=\"pill transparent\">\n            <span class=\"label\">Action</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pill transparent\">\n            <span class=\"label\">Instantaneous</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"pill transparent\">\n            <span class=\"label\">Self</span>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</div>",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-04T16:58:50.081Z"
    },
